# Overrides GNU Stow's built-in default ignore list for this package (Stow
# replaces, not merges, the default list once a local one is present — see
# `info stow`), so it's reproduced here plus our own entries below.
#
# CHEATSHEET.md is repo documentation for browsing on GitHub/locally, not a
# dotfile meant to land in $HOME — it would otherwise collide with nvim's
# package of the same name.

# Comments and blank lines are allowed.

RCS
.+,v

CVS
\.\#.+       # CVS conflict files / emacs lock files
\.cvsignore

\.svn
_darcs
\.hg

\.git
\.gitignore
\.gitmodules

.+~          # emacs backup files
\#.*\#       # emacs autosave files

^/README.*
^/LICENSE.*
^/COPYING

^/CHEATSHEET\.md$
